  "description": "The Subvert HT5 Plus is a natural at diving into turns and slopes, and mastering rocky terrain thanks to its plus size tires. The HT5 models features an X6 alloy 27.5\" Plus geometry frame with a tapered head tube and internal cable routing. Its ultra cushy ride comes courtesy of its Rockshox Recon RL 27.5\"+ Boost fork with 120mm of travel combined with new WTB i35 27.5\" rims w/ TCS 2.0 tape and Kenda Havoc 27.5 x 2.8\" 120tpi tires, all tubeless ready. Its SLX 7000 1x11 drive train, fitted with an FSA Comet Boost crankset and a 30t chainring, keeps pedaling and shifting smooth, fast and efficient for easy climbing.\nNew X6 alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, tapered head tube, 73mm BB shell, Boost thru-axle dropouts\nNew Rockshox Recon RL 27.5+/29\" Boost fork, 120mm travel, tapered\nFSA Comet Modular Boost crankset, 30T Crmo Chainring\nShimano SLX 7000 1x11-spd Shadow Plus rear derailleur & shifter\nShimano SLX 7000 11-46T cassette\nWTB i35 27.5\" Plus rims w/ TCS 2.0 tape, tubeless ready\nKenda Havoc 27.5x2.8\" tires, TCS, Aramid beads, 120 tpi\nNew Shimano MT-400 Hydraulic disc brakeset",
